BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Brevia EX3 Espresso Machine - Instructions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before first use) Tj T*
(Rinse the water tank and fill it with fresh cold water. Run two empty cycles through the) Tj T*
(group head and the steam wand.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Making espresso) Tj T*
(Use 18 grams of finely ground coffee for a double shot. Tamp with even pressure. A good) Tj T*
(shot takes 25 to 30 seconds and gives about 36 grams of espresso. The pump delivers 15) Tj T*
(bar.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Milk) Tj T*
(Purge the steam wand before and after steaming. Keep the tip just below the surface) Tj T*
(until the milk reaches about 60 degrees.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Descaling) Tj T*
(Descale every two months, or when the orange descale light comes on. Use Brevia) Tj T*
(descaling liquid diluted 1:4 with water and run the descale programme \(hold both cup) Tj T*
(buttons for 5 seconds\). Never use vinegar; it damages the seals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Warranty) Tj T*
(Two years from the date of purchase. The warranty is void if the machine has not been) Tj T*
(descaled as described above.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
